      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medina_County%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The county’s name comes from the Medina River, itself named in 1689 by Spanish explorer Alonso de León after cartographer Pedro de Medina.",
